Review the taxonomy before using it
The saved output contains the following 23 topics in ten groups. The group names provide a broader view for reporting, while the individual topics are the labels used for more detailed analysis.

The complete topic list: 23 topics in ten groups Each card lists one group. Bars count mapped candidate entries, not review frequencies.

