Names such as “Financial friction” and “Dignity & vulnerability” are editorial navigation aids. A group does not imply that all its topics are connected to each other or share a cause. Likewise, a blank matrix cell means no qualifying pair is displayed, rather than no relationship or no important experience. The map is selective by design; it complements the frequency ranking rather than replacing it.
